   "pc_requirements": {
    "minimum": "<strong>最低配備:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>作業系統:</strong> Windows 10/11 - 64-Bit (Latest Update).<br></li><li><strong>處理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or Intel Core i5 6600k<br></li><li><strong>記憶體:</strong> DDR4 Dual Channel 8 GB 記憶體<br></li><li><strong>顯示卡:</strong> AMD RX 570 or Nvidia GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> 版本：12<br></li><li><strong>網路:</strong> 寬頻網際網路連線<br></li><li><strong>儲存空間:</strong> 100 GB 可用空間<br></li><li><strong>備註:</strong> Estimated performance when set to &quot;&quot;Low&quot;&quot; preset: 1280x720 @ 60 FPS SSD Recommended</li></ul>",
    "recommended": "<strong>建議配備:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>作業系統:</strong> Windows 10/11 - 64-Bit (Latest Update).<br></li><li><strong>處理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 2700X or Intel Core i7 6700<br></li><li><strong>記憶體:</strong> Dual Channel 12 GB 記憶體<br></li><li><strong>顯示卡:</strong> AMD RX 5600 XT or Nvidia GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> 版本：12<br></li><li><strong>網路:</strong> 寬頻網際網路連線<br></li><li><strong>儲存空間:</strong> 100 GB 可用空間<br></li><li><strong>備註:</strong> Estimated performance when set to &quot;&quot;Medium&quot;&quot; preset: 1920x1080 @ 60 FPS SSD Required</li></ul>"
